# 줄바꿈·diff·언어통계 규약 — 전 repo 동일본. https://git-scm.com/docs/gitattributes
# 기본: 텍스트는 LF 정규화(.editorconfig 와 정합), 바이너리는 정규화 금지.
* text=auto eol=lf

# 명시적 텍스트(코드·설정) ───────────────────────────────────────
*.py     text
*.go     text
*.rs     text
*.java   text
*.kt     text
*.kts    text
*.js     text
*.jsx    text
*.ts     text
*.tsx    text
*.mjs    text
*.cjs    text
*.vue    text
*.svelte text
*.css    text
*.scss   text
*.html   text
*.sql    text
*.proto  text
*.sh     text
*.tf     text
*.tofu   text
*.hcl    text
*.yaml   text
*.yml    text
*.json   text
*.toml   text
*.md     text
*.gradle text

# Windows 스크립트는 CRLF 유지 / Gradle wrapper 양분 ──────────────
*.bat       text eol=crlf
*.cmd       text eol=crlf
*.ps1       text eol=crlf
gradlew     text eol=lf
gradlew.bat text eol=crlf

# 생성물·lock — diff 억제 + 언어 통계 제외(linguist) ──────────────
# *.lock 은 poetry/uv/yarn/Cargo/Pipfile.lock 을 모두 포함.
*.lock              linguist-generated
.terraform.lock.hcl text linguist-generated
package-lock.json   linguist-generated
pnpm-lock.yaml      linguist-generated
go.sum              linguist-generated
*.min.js            linguist-generated
*.min.css           linguist-generated
*.map               linguist-generated
*_pb2.py            linguist-generated
*_pb2_grpc.py       linguist-generated
*.pb.go             linguist-generated

